    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e54eca3e01678a4fdd1d90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从她外表上看身体并无大碍。\n训练期间也很健康，可是……\n考虑到今天的训练内容，我觉得她应该很累了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3510cd30924309f2a11fa04d2211c4a88ce0967b277a2aa29054629ae863e70e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
